{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:89593f85d8154c01","name":"Blast Cannon","source":{"id":"source:reference-89593f85d8154c01","title":"Blast Cannon","revision":16259,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:35Z","sha256":"fb68234d887251f3f99bee45c427bf8f7eeeb93c72a6cf7e79ba703156cf2545","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16259","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Blast%20Cannon&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-89593f85d8154c01","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]}," \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Golan Arms Blast Cannon, colloquially known as the \"Blaster Shotgun,\" is a devastating close-quarters weapon often issued to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Gunners?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and engineers to aid them in repelling an attack on their positions. It fires multiple individual blaster shots in a spread with a single pull of the trigger. At very close ranges, all of these shots will usually hit the same target (with devastating results), and at larger ranges, the spread of the shots deals damage to multiple targets. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by Golan Arms under exclusive contract with the Republic, and then the Empire, the CR-1 Blast Cannon fires a burst of blaster bolts, each at reduced power, that spread out in an ever-expanding wave of energy. Often used to suppress riots or eliminate threats gathered in large crowds, the CR-1 Blast Cannon can be incredibly lethal at Short and Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", but becomes ineffective at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Blast Cannon is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," for the purposes of determining the weapon's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". However, the Blast Cannon does not take ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties to attack rolls, instead applying any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties to damage rolls. Against adjacent targets, the Blast Cannon deals an additional 1d8 points of damage. Against nonadjacent targets, the Blast Cannon acts as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"}," weapon with a 1-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"}," radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Blast Cannon requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 10 shots (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},") or 5 shots (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"), the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8 (see above)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Stun Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 6 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"}," (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"); ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"}," (",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
